      "voice_name": "Chris - Charming, Down-to-Earth",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "The boats go out before light and are back by noon. Whatever they land, I put on the ice. If you catch your own, the wholesale counter at the dock buys it.",
